WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:05.320
Good evening, Patriots, General, Q, fellow Anons.

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:09.520
This here is a rubber duck, and I am here to take my oath.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:11.400
Here's my Bible.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:13.680
Let's do it.

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:16.480
I do solemnly swear that I will support

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:19.000
and defend the Constitution of the United States

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:21.900
against all enemies, foreign and domestic.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.420
That I will bear true faith and allegiance to the same.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.660
That I take this obligation freely
without any mental reservation

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:31.280
or purpose of evasion,

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:35.360
and that I will well and faithfully discharge
the duties of the office

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.000
on which I am about to enter,

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:38.740
so help me God.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:41.560
Where we go one, we go all.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:43.860
Do it, Q.
